# G6 — Cross-Language Opposition and Asymmetry Comparison
# CLCA Protocol v3.3 (Global Phase)

You are given opposition and naturalness tables (F5 and F6) showing how each language encodes contrastive structures and how natural or unnatural certain truth-related combinations are.

